<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed narrowly mixed on Friday in active trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 4.24 to 6931.62. It ended the week down 57.34 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.08 to 421.01. It finished the week down 2.47.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.01.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1270 to 1210.</p>
<p>Volume was 478,296,040 compared with 490,243,020 on Thursday. Weekly volume was 1,967,806,040.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
